    {
      "_id": "kZa33xdq1JGoAGdE",
      "name": "活化巨石 Animate Boulders",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "139",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>格萊石人以魔法活化身邊60尺內它能看到的至多兩塊石塊。每塊石塊的資料與格萊石人相仿，但石塊的智力和魅力均爲1。石塊不受魅惑或恐慌，也無法活化其他石塊。石塊在該格萊石人維持專注的過程中保持活化，該過程至多持續1分鐘（如同專注於法術）。</p><p>The galeb duhr magically animates up to two boulders it can see within 60 feet of it. A boulder has statistics like those of a galeb duhr, except it has Intelligence 1 and Charisma 1, it can't be &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] or &amp;Reference[condition=frightened], and it lacks this action option. A boulder remains animated as long as the galeb duhr maintains @status[concentration], up to 1 minute (as if @status[concentration||concentrating] on a spell).</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
