    {
      "_id": "COtDWHSkZKG2rs6c",
      "name": "碾壓衝鋒 Rolling Charge",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "139",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><p>若格萊石人向其目標直線移動至少20尺，且在同一回合裏以猛擊攻擊命中該目標，則該目標受額外7（2d6）點鈍擊傷害。若目標是生物，則該生物必須成功通過一次DC 16的力量豁免，否則應擊倒地。</p><p>If the galeb duhr rolls at least 20 feet straight toward a target and then hits it with a slam attack on the same turn, the target takes an extra 7 ([[/damage 2d6 type=bludgeoning]]) damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a [[/save ability=str dc=16]] saving throw or be knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone].</p></div></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
